# The key that encrypts every person's saved AI keys and the Mealie and openGym tokens
# (AES-256-GCM). Start.ps1 makes app.env on the first start. It is the base64 of 32 random bytes.
# Read by the app and the worker only. Backup.ps1 copies it next to the database dumps: without
# it a restored database cannot read the saved keys, and everyone has to enter them again.
# Never change it.
CAL_SECRET_KEY=
